casts at Nasdaq.com.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3193a192cf54ed3a\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.nasdaq.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"26b830539ddc21b9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla Releases Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2023 Financial Results | Tesla Investor Relations\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"26b830539ddc21b9\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ir.tesla.com/press-release/tesla-releases-fourth-quarter-and-full-year-2023-financial-results\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a64bafe3f72b3ff1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAUSTIN, Texas, January 24, 2024 – <strong>Tesla has released its financial results for the fourth quarter and full year ended December 31, 2023</strong> by posting an update on its Investor Relations website.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a64bafe3f72b3ff1\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 24, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ir.tesla.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8464e8240b1ff329\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla (TSLA) 2023 Q4 earnings\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8464e8240b1ff329\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cnbc.com/2024/01/24/tesla-tsla-earnings-q4-2023.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"89be1c3132242912\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n$25.6 billion expected by LSEG. <strong>Total revenue increased 3% from $24.3 billion a year earlier</strong>. Operating margin for the quarter came in at 8.2%, down from the year-ago quarter&#x27;s figure of 16% and slightly higher than 7.6% in the prior quarter.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"89be1c3132242912\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 25, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cnbc.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3fd095fb554381d6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n--